abstract: "Aggregate statistics from one operator's multi-agent fleet: every task the coordinator dispatched to an agent since February 2026, with its estimate, its measured actual, and the receiver-side autonomy audit record. Rows stay private; the definition, the scripts and the aggregates are the disclosure."
